  &lt;div style="font-weight: 700; color: #4fc3f7;"&gt;5-Fold Cross-Validated Accuracy&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;small style="color: #81d4fa;"&gt;Over 2.1&times; better than random chance&lt;/small&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


